                    "src": "K_{HClO}\\cdot\\frac1{K_{HF}}\\;=\\;2.9\\times10^{-8}\\cdot\\frac1{3.5\\times10^{-4}}\\;=\\;8.3\\times10^{-5}\\\\\\\\",
                    "subtype": "latex",
                    "type": "formula_inline"
                  }
